-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §5: the reform applies gradually to all
-- teaching employees from 1.9.2007, and is complete no later than 1.9.2013.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `5`

@ref akn:art_5
`the reform applies from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007
`the reform is complete by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013

-- The State's undertaking: every teaching employee is under the reform by
-- 1.9.2013. Time is counted in days from 1.9.2007.
DECLARE `section 5 action` IS ONE OF `complete applying the reform to all teaching employees`

`days from the start to the completion` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL `the reform is complete by` MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the reform applies from`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 5 action`
DECIDE `completing the reform` IS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `complete applying the reform to all teaching employees`
    WITHIN `days from the start to the completion`
    LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 5: the reform is complete no later than 1.9.2013"

#ASSERT `days from the start to the completion` EQUALS 2192

#TRACE `completing the reform` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the State` DOES `complete applying the reform to all teaching employees` AT 2192
